    {"start": 20.801, "end": 23.12, "lines": ["Well, can you tell me? So."]},
    {"start": 23.12, "end": 24.28, "lines": ["Obviously, I think"]},
    {"start": 24.88, "end": 27.36, "lines": ["most of us are not very tech savvy."]},
    {"start": 27.36, "end": 31.2, "lines": ["So I'm pretty sure you did not build","this yourself. So can you tell us"]},
