    {"start": 34.16, "end": 36.08, "lines": ["Exactly. I wouldn't either."]},
    {"start": 36.08, "end": 39.78, "lines": ["So can you tell us a little bit","more about how that partnership"]},
    {"start": 40, "end": 45.88, "lines": ["with the contractor that you worked","with to build the Leadbot as well?"]},
    {"start": 46.24, "end": 48.64, "lines": ["Actually, tell us how that kind","of developed,"]},
    {"start": 48.64, "end": 52.82, "lines": ["where you kind of had that relationship","built from, and how that worked."]},
    {"start": 53.12, "end": 58.16, "lines": ["Yeah, so when I started at the health","department about five years ago,"]},
    {"start": 58.16, "end": 62.12, "lines": ["that was a relationship","that had already been established."]},
    {"start": 62.48, "end": 64.4, "lines": ["And, you know, through the process"]},
    {"start": 64.4, "end": 68.16, "lines": ["of working with them and talking","with other staff members here,"]},
    {"start": 68.16, "end": 73.44, "lines": ["I was able to learn a little bit more","about how that relationship began."]},
    {"start": 73.44, "end": 77.44, "lines": ["And it was, I actually, I don't know"]},
    {"start": 77.44, "end": 81.88, "lines": ["how long ago the relationship started,","but it was, we had."]},
    {"start": 82.256, "end": 85.616, "lines": ["their help with something","on a very small scale."]},
